{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "New Paths"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Returning Your Call"}, {"type": "position", "content": 5}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 1}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use important information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. "}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le01ob05re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking on the Phone"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "To keep a conversation going in English, it's important to show that you are interested in talking to your friend. When you couldn't answer the phone you need to return your call as soon as possible this shows that you are interested in talking to someone.<br /><br /> For example:<br />  <span class=\"italic\">Hey Sally, I'm returning your call!</span> <br /><span class=\"italic\">Peter! How are you?</span><br /><br />On the other hand, you can also show interest by asking questions or by responding to or commenting on what the person you are talking to says."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Speaker\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Listener\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Waiting for a response from the PR firm is stressful.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Wow. You're always so easy-going and calm.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">That's good for PR right?</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Yeah. I'll just have to wait.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm going apartment hunting in Boston this weekend.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">There's the old optimistic Peter!</span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " The Future with Will,  Be going to, and the Present Continuous"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Talking about the future can be very confusing ..."}, {"type": "text", "content": "We use <span class=\"italic\">Will</span> to express future intentions that are decided at the time of speaking (spontaneous offers, promises and decisions)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">But</span>, we use <span class=\"italic\">Going to</span> to express future intentions that have already been decided before the time of speaking."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Come on, I'<span class=\"strong\">ll help</span> you with those bags. (seeing that someone is struggling with their shopping bags)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "      I can't make it on Saturday. I'<span class=\"strong\">m going to help</span> my parents around the house. (referring to a decision that the speaker has made in the past)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "We use <span class=\"italic\">Will</span>  to make predictions that are based on personal judgement, opinion or intuition."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">But</span>, we use<span class=\"italic\">Going to</span>to make predictions that are based on present evidence. The predicted event is either very near (and can be seen) or seems sure to happen."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'm sure you'<span class=\"strong\">ll have</span> a lovely time in Italy. (opinion)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "My sister'<span class=\"strong\">s going to</span> have a baby. (we can see that she is pregnant)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "We use <span class=\"italic\">Going to</span> to refers to future intentions that have been decided but have not been fully planned."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">But</span>, we use the <span class=\"italic\">Present Continuous</span> to refers to fixed future events and emphasises that plans or arrangements have already been made."}, {"type": "example", "content": "We'<span class=\"strong\">re going to</span> get married. (referring to a past decision)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "We <span class=\"strong\">are getting</span> married next month. (the wedding has already been arranged)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "We can also use the <span class=\"italic\">present simple</span> for something scheduled or arranged."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">We have</span> a lesson next Monday. (the lesson has already been scheduled)</span>"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "stressful "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "causing worry and anxiety  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: His job is very stressful at times. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le01ob05aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about work."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "easy-going "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "relaxed; tolerant "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My boss is very easy-going. Nothing upsets him. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le01ob05aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "practical"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "choosing appropriate doable action  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They alway arrive at a practical solution to a problem."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le01ob05aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "asset "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "something useful or valuable "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She is an asset to the firm. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le01ob05aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "personable"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "pleasant; likable "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The secretary is extremely personable. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le01ob05aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "talkative "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "fond of talking; chatty "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He is talkative and puts customers at ease. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le01ob05aud06  "}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Review the dialogue."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write down 7 words that describe personality and behavior that will help you get or move up in a job."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use these words write sentences saying how they make you an asset to your job. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Give an example for each."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your sentences to a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write 7 words to describe personality and behavior."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I say how this personality and behavior make me an asset to a job."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read my sentences aloud."}]}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [0], "type": "WLC", "questions": [], "img_path": "", "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about job and work."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about behavior and personality. 