5re2img06.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Hey Sally. I'm returning your call! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Peter! How are you?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'm okay. I'm usually a very patient person, but waiting for a response from the PR firm is stressful.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Wow. You're always so easy-going and calm. This PR job must mean a lot to you. <br>"}, {"time": "20000", "image": "engenn6le01ob05re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'm going apartment hunting in Boston this weekend. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You're going to take an apartment without a job? There's the old optimistic Peter!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'll have a good look at places. I won't take a place until I'm hired.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You'll have an idea of what's available. You're showing your practical side.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'm sending out a second set of resumes next week. I'm going to be starting at the bottom. I'd be an asset in social media or public relations. <br>"}, {"time": "50500", "image": "engenn6le01ob05re2img05.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You'll find a place and do well. You're personable and talkative. That's good for PR right?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yeah. I'll just have to wait. I'm going to find a place to work. I just want it to be right for me.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Something is coming for you. I feel it. Bye!<br>"}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}]}